[arXiv:2502.14960] ( https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.14960 ).\n\n\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]A Limit on the Total Lepton Number in the Universe \
from BBN and the CMB\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], Valerie Domcke, Miguel \
Escudero, Mario Fernandez Navarro and Stefan Sandner,\n[JCAP 02 (2026) 017] ( \
https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1475-7516/2026/02/017 ), \
[arXiv:2510.02438] ( https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.02438 ).\n\nLast major \
